      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1700000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Phase 1: Agentic traces\n  (capture tool call patterns)\n\nPhase 2: Extract patterns\n  -> hardcode as T1 pipelines\n\nPhase 3: Fine-tune 0.6-1.4B\n  SLM for uncommon patterns\n  (tool routing only)\n\nPhase 4: Parametric memory\n  (model weights = childhood)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Phase 1: Agentic traces\n  (capture tool call patterns)\n\nPhase 2: Extract patterns\n  -> hardcode as T1 pipelines\n\nPhase 3: Fine-tune 0.6-1.4B\n  SLM for uncommon patterns\n  (tool routing only)\n\nPhase 4: Parametric memory\n  (model weights = childhood)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
